OL,3,AUS envoys meet Putin in Moscow for
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's top
OL,7,Fnegotiators are meeting Russian
OL,8,FPresident Vladimir Putin in Moscow, as
OL,9,Fefforts to end the war in Ukraine
OL,10,Fgather pace.
OL,12,FFootage released by the Kremlin showed
OL,13,FSteve Witkoff and Jared Kushner being
OL,14,Fgreeted by Putin, who said the current
OL,15,Fsituation "is not so easy". He added
OL,16,FRussia would explain "how we see the
OL,17,Fsituation".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
