OL,3,AUS envoys meet Putin in Moscow for
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitkoff thanked the Putin for agreeing
OL,7,Fwith Ukraine to halt strikes on each
OL,8,Fother's capitals for three days. On
OL,9,FSunday the envoys will travel to Kyiv
OL,10,Ffor more talks.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Trump said Witkoff and
OL,13,FKushner were "bringing with them a
OL,14,Fproposal to end the war". So far,
OL,15,Fefforts from the US and its allies to
OL,16,Fbroker a peace deal have failed.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
